# 统一行尾策略：仓库存 LF，检出按平台。
# 避免 Windows/macOS 协作者之间产生「整文件行尾变更」的伪 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须 CRLF，否则 cmd.exe 解析异常
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 二进制：禁止任何行尾/文本转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.pdf binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
